OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to physio, 20,
OL,4,Akilled in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sports physiotherapist and keen rugby
OL,7,Fplayer who died in a crash in
OL,8,FNorthamptonshire was "loved beyond
OL,9,Fwords and would be missed beyond
OL,10,Fmeasure", his family has said.
OL,12,FAiden Seekings, 20, died in a
OL,13,Fsingle-vehicle crash in Oakley Road,
OL,14,FRushton, near Kettering, at about 14:30
OL,15,FGMT on 4 November.
OL,17,FIn a statement, his family said he was
OL,18,Fa much-loved son, brother and friend
OL,19,Fwho was "funny, caring, thoughtful and
OL,20,Fhad a wonderful ability to light up any
OL,21,Froom he walked into".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
